{"version":1,"content":"<p>想像你乘電梯時，樓層顯示從1層升到2層、3層，隨後突然跳到20層，你從未經過中間的樓層。在量子世界裏，電子也能完成類似的能量跳躍。如今，物理學家找到了一種方法，能夠像放慢鏡頭一樣觀察這一過程。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588322.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:03:53.305127+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:49:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_hash":"9747683e46ca5dac1c72c0bf9b0e4b7ea94ffd2dc099d26e16e863e0e5182ed1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}